          "text": "We accept NJ childcare subsidy"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000h1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000h2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The New Jersey Child Care Assistance Program (CCAP) helps working families, and families in school or training, pay for child care. Uriah Child Care accepts CCAP for families who qualify, for toddler care, kindergarten readiness and before and after school care."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000h3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000h4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How CCAP works in Cumberland County"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000h5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000h6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Cumberland County, CCAP is managed by the local child care resource and referral agency, Rutgers Southern Regional CCR&R. Its Vineland office is at 415 W Landis Ave, Suite 202, and you can call them at "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000h8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000h7"
          ],
          "text": "(856) 462-6800"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000h9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". You apply through the state's Child Care Assistance Program, and the agency decides eligibility and your family's share of the cost. Rules and income limits are set by the state and can change, so check the official "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000hb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000ha"
          ],
          "text": "NJ Child Care Assistance Program"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000hc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " website for the latest."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
